#. Detail line of the last onboarding page.
msgctxt "intro_quick_connect_details"
msgid "Turn URnetwork on and off from Quick Settings, and keep an eye on it from your home screen."
msgstr "Activez et désactivez URnetwork depuis les Réglages rapides, et gardez un œil dessus depuis votre écran d’accueil."

#. Detail line of the last onboarding page on iOS/macOS (Control Center instead of Quick Settings).
msgctxt "intro_quick_connect_details_apple"
msgid "Turn URnetwork on and off from Control Center, and keep an eye on it from your Home Screen."
msgstr "Activez et désactivez URnetwork depuis le Centre de contrôle, et gardez un œil dessus depuis votre écran d’accueil."

#. Title of the last onboarding page: the quick connect tile and the home screen widgets.
msgctxt "intro_quick_connect_title"
msgid "Connect in one tap"
msgstr "Connexion en un geste"

#. Label shown on the last onboarding page once the quick connect tile is in Quick Settings.
msgctxt "intro_quick_tile_added"
msgid "Added to Quick Settings"
msgstr "Ajouté aux Réglages rapides"

#. Manual steps for adding the quick connect tile on Android versions without the system add-tile request (before Android 13).
msgctxt "intro_quick_tile_manual"
msgid "Open Quick Settings, tap the pencil, and drag URnetwork into place."
msgstr "Ouvrez les Réglages rapides, touchez le crayon et faites glisser URnetwork à sa place."

#. Tagline under 'Welcome to URnetwork' on the first onboarding page. Replaces 'URnetwork is the most local and most private network on the planet.'
msgctxt "intro_verifiable_encryption"
msgid "Encryption for everyday use."
msgstr "Le chiffrement au quotidien."

#. Manual steps for adding widgets on launchers without the pin dialog.
msgctxt "intro_widgets_manual"
msgid "Long-press your home screen, choose Widgets, and pick URnetwork."
msgstr "Appuyez de manière prolongée sur votre écran d’accueil, choisissez Widgets et sélectionnez URnetwork."

#. How to add a Home Screen widget on iOS (no pin-widget API).
msgctxt "intro_widgets_manual_ios"
msgid "Long-press the Home Screen, tap +, search URnetwork, and add a widget."
msgstr "Maintenez le doigt sur l’écran d’accueil, touchez +, recherchez URnetwork et ajoutez un widget."

#. How to add a desktop widget on macOS.
msgctxt "intro_widgets_manual_macos"
msgid "Open the widget gallery from Notification Center, search URnetwork, and drag a widget to the desktop."
msgstr "Ouvrez la galerie de widgets depuis le Centre de notifications, recherchez URnetwork et faites glisser un widget sur le bureau."

#. Hint under the widget previews on the last onboarding page: tapping a preview asks the launcher to add that widget.
msgctxt "intro_widgets_tap_to_add"
msgid "Tap a widget to add it to your home screen."
msgstr "Touchez un widget pour l’ajouter à votre écran d’accueil."

