#. Label for the terms and conditions acceptance checkbox.
#. It should read like "I agree to URnetwork's <link>Terms and Services</link> and <link>Privacy Policy</link>"
#. 
#. The {terms_start} and {terms_end} markers wrap the "Terms and Services" text.
#. The {privacy_start} and {privacy_end} markers wrap the "Privacy Policy" text.
#. 
#. Platform-specific rendering:
#. - Web: Replace {terms_start} with <a href="/terms">, {terms_end} with </a>, etc.
#. - iOS: Use these markers to identify ranges for NSAttributedString link attributes
#. - Android: Use these markers to identify ranges for ClickableSpan
#. 
msgctxt "terms_checkbox"
msgid "I agree to URnetwork's {terms_start}Terms and Services{terms_end} and {privacy_start}Privacy Policy{privacy_end}"
msgstr "J'accepte les {terms_start}Conditions d'utilisation{terms_end} et la {privacy_start}Politique de confidentialité{privacy_end} d'URnetwork"

#. Get Pro screen: debug button that replays the Pro celebration animation.
msgctxt "test_animation"
msgid "Test animation"
msgstr "Tester l'animation"

#. Used in Shared/Views/PurchaseSuccessView.swift.
msgctxt "thanks_for_building_the_new_internet_with_us"
msgid "Thanks for building the new internet with us"
msgstr "Merci de construire le nouvel internet avec nous"

#. Confirmation shown after feedback is sent.
msgctxt "thanks_for_the_feedback"
msgid "Thanks for the feedback!"
msgstr "Merci pour votre retour !"

#. Shown inline in the upgrade flow when a StoreKit purchase attempt throws (Shared/ViewModels/AppStoreSubscriptionManager.swift). Every purchase failure is shown to the user — a payment error they cannot see is one they will hit again. User cancellation is not an error and never shows this.
msgctxt "the_purchase_could_not_be_completed"
msgid "The purchase could not be completed. Please try again."
msgstr "L’achat n’a pas pu aboutir. Réessayez."

#. Used in Authenticate/CreateNetwork/CreateNetworkViewModel.swift.
msgctxt "there_was_an_error_checking_the_network_name"
msgid "There was an error checking the network name"
msgstr "Une erreur s'est produite lors de la vérification du nom du réseau"

#. Used in Authenticate/LoginInitial/LoginInitialView.swift.
msgctxt "there_was_an_error_logging_in"
msgid "There was an error logging in"
msgstr "Une erreur s'est produite lors de la connexion"

#. Used in Authenticate/LoginInitial/AuthCodeLoginSheet.swift.
msgctxt "there_was_an_error_validating_your_auth_code"
msgid "There was an error validating your auth code. Please try again or generate a new one"
msgstr "Une erreur s’est produite lors de la validation de votre code d’authentification. Veuillez réessayer ou en générer un nouveau."

#. A warning message displayed in the seedphrase display view.
msgctxt "this_is_the_only_time_you_ll"
msgid "⚠️ This is the ONLY time you'll see this."
msgstr "⚠️ C’est la seule et unique fois que vous la verrez."

#. Shown inline in the upgrade flow when the server's verify answer for a purchase's transaction JWS is terminal `invalid` — the proof will never verify. The transaction is still finished so StoreKit stops redelivering it; this message is how the failure reaches the user instead of a silent success (Shared/ViewModels/AppStoreSubscriptionManager.swift). Apple sibling of purchase_could_not_be_verified (android).
msgctxt "this_purchase_couldn_t_be_verified"
msgid "This purchase couldn't be verified with the App Store, so it can't be applied to your account. If you were charged and your plan doesn't update, please contact support."
msgstr "Cet achat n’a pas pu être vérifié auprès de l’App Store, il ne peut donc pas être appliqué à votre compte. Si vous avez été débité et que votre forfait ne se met pas à jour, contactez l’assistance."

#. dns settings
msgctxt "this_region"
msgid "this region"
msgstr "Cette région"

